{"reviews":[{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-0","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly as Advertised","x":"I love these. Durable when liquid is applied. Easy to us. Highly recommended. They are very soft. I use them for toner, makeup remover, and nail polish remover. Also, they don't fall apart the way cheaper cotton rounds do. These do not shed, so no picking stray fibers off your nails after removing polish. They came with a complimentary package. Thanks!  I will buy again soon.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-1","r":5.0,"t":"The best on Amazon","x":"This cotton is GREAT for removing make-up and nail polish! Very soft but also durable.  I am usually allergic to a lot of brands but these must be truly hypoallergenic because they work just fine for me. Definetely will be a repeat customer!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-2","r":5.0,"t":"definetely will buy again","x":"Products has arrived just as described. Quality is exceptional and plus it is organic!!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-3","r":5.0,"t":"Plenty to use all around","x":"The product arrived in time and was exactly like the way it was advertised. It has three big packs of the rounds that will last you a long time. My wife immediately tried it and she loved it. We will definitely buy it again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-4","r":5.0,"t":"High quality product","x":"Excellent Seller. Just as described. Item was shipped well packaged. Received in a timely manner. Definitely Recommended!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-5","r":5.0,"t":"The best quality","x":"My wife has skin problems and using medical grade cotton, its so expensive that we look for other options. Seem like we finally find a nice one Thanks for the product Absolutely top notch","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-6","r":5.0,"t":"Soft cotton, great quality, excellent packaging. Will add to mostly delivery list.","x":"Soft cotton, great quality, excellent packaging. Will add to mostly delivery list.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-7","r":4.0,"t":"Great value","x":"They\u2019re durable. They don\u2019t fall apart while taking off your makeup. They\u2019re soft and a good price. I gave it 4 stars because I love the product but it didn\u2019t come with the extra travel pack like it says.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-8","r":5.0,"t":"X","x":"it\u2019s very useful product and fast delivery,  Thank you so much","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-9","r":5.0,"t":"Better Than Any on the Market!","x":"These are wonderful! They are better than any other brand I've used over the years. They do not have lint, they do not come apart, they are evenly thick and nicely sized.  I use these to keep my dog's eyes clean. She has a lot of discharge and needs them wiped daily. These are so great because they are thick but soft and sturdy. No lint or strands of cotton get in my dog's eyes. I use at least one a day for her.  And I use several every day myself... to use micellar water to cleanse my entire fa","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product for a Good Price","x":"I usually buy my cotton rounds from Walmart, but my husband suggested that I start buying things I use often online. I took a chance on these and was pleasantly surprised. The quality is really good for the price. They're pretty durable and don't fall apart like some other ones I've used. They are also organic which is a plus. The best part was the travel pack included. It not only included cotton rounds but cotton swabs as well. I would purchase these again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-11","r":5.0,"t":"missing 100 cotton rounds !","x":"The cotton rounds seem to be good quality but I did not receive 300 cotton rounds. only received 200. am still waiting to hear from the seller :( update :  since writing the first review I have  been compensated for the  100 cotton rounds that were missing. Thank You","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-12","r":5.0,"t":"It\u2019s organic and very soft. As described.","x":"My wife is Absolutely love this product so far. She use these for almost everything She can - makeup removal, applying toner, cleaning, etc. She love that they are organic cotton and still super soft and plush. She loved it...","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-13","r":4.0,"t":"Decent cotton rounds, very soft, durable.","x":"Decent cotton rounds, very soft, durable. The only reason I subtracted 1 star is because of the thickness. These are a little thinner compared to other brands, but they still work for makeup removal purposes.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-14","r":5.0,"t":"These are clean rounds.","x":"I am very happy with this product. The rounds leave virtually NO lint. They hold together very well when I wet them with my toner. A very good value. I will be buying them again. Thank you.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-15","r":5.0,"t":"It is what it is","x":"It is flat cotton, I purchased it to clean my puppy\u2019s ears , it can be used pretty much for anything such as cleaning nail polish, tu rub a wound with alcohol remove make up etc.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-16","r":5.0,"t":"Cotton pads","x":"Love theses cotton pads. Doesn\u2019t leave lint anywhere on my face and is sturdy as well. It would be nice if they offered a larger size but nevertheless I will continue to buy!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-17","r":3.0,"t":"Lint...Lint...Lint","x":"These are pretty soft but if your trying to use them for touch ups like getting off extra mascara it leaves lint all over your eyelashes. Now I only use these wet.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-18","r":5.0,"t":"Softest!!","x":"This is the softest cotton I\u2019ve ever used! Love!!! Also doesn\u2019t shed like other brands. Shipping was fast! Def. gonna order again soon!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-19","r":5.0,"t":"Better than most of the brands!","x":"I like the quality of organic cotton. It's soft and works great. Better than most of the brands that are out there!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-20","r":2.0,"t":"Lies not lint free","x":"Definitely NOT lintfree. I have to brush off my face with a makeup brush to get rid of lint","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-21","r":5.0,"t":"Very Good Product","x":"Much better than using cotton balls to remove makeup...used one round to 3-4 cotton balls","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-22","r":5.0,"t":"High Quality","x":"They are perfect for the price and work great for my purposes. Will buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love the soft cotton.","x":"Great value and very soft cotton. I woulld reccomend there cotton rounds.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07KDYT8XY-24","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent quality","x":"Bought it for my wife and she's happy with the product, excellent quality","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the cotton rounds as soft and durable, noting they hold together and don't fall apart during use.","cites":[1,2,8,10,11,14,15]},{"text":"Many customers say the product matches its description and is a good value, with several planning to buy again.","cites":[1,3,4,5,8,11,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers highlight that the rounds leave little to no lint and don't shed fibers.","cites":[1,10,15]},{"text":"A few customers mention the organic cotton and its suitability for sensitive skin.","cites":[2,3,6,13]},{"text":"A small number of reviews report issues with quantity or thickness, including missing rounds and thinner-than-expected pads.","cites":[8,12,14]}]},"qa":[]}